What:		/sys/class/leds/lcd-backlight/brightness
What:		/sys/class/leds/lcd-backlight/max_brightness
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	Linux backlight mailing list <dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org>
Description:
		Compatibility interface for the cannon light HAL. Brightness
		ranges from 0 to 2047, with the same units as the backlight-class
		interface. Writes use the backlight core and respect panel blanking.
